72
00:08:53,495 --> 00:09:00,693
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) appointed Abu Obaid As-Saqafi(أبوعبيدألثَّقفي) to lead the army that would go to Iraq.

73
00:09:04,222 --> 00:09:06,329
The Sahabah(صحابه) were in the army, they said:

74
00:09:06,354 --> 00:09:09,691
why don't you appoint one of the Muhajireen(مهاجرين) or Al-Ansaar(ألأنْصَار)?

75
00:09:10,679 --> 00:09:14,796
Why don't you appoint one of these Sahabah(صحابه) to lead this army?

76
00:09:14,821 --> 00:09:16,569
