81
00:09:33,563 --> 00:09:37,824
you are ahead of everyone else because you became Muslim first,

82
00:09:39,804 --> 00:09:41,928
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) is telling the Sahabah(صحابه).

83
00:09:42,452 --> 00:09:48,039
The reason why you have a special status is because you became Muslim before everyone else.

84
00:09:49,202 --> 00:09:56,374
